<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="SAIKAI"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Mili"/><amll:meta key="album" value="SAIKAI"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3336080601"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="0029oait3ogMaj"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="1TmMyrEWgX3WILJsOD0IBp"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1866507194"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="122847541"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="xiaowumin-mark"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Cassie Wei</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="4:40.652"><div begin="30.437" end="4:40.652"><p begin="30.437" end="35.505" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.437" end="30.872">When</span> <span begin="30.872" end="31.473">I</span> <span begin="32.283" end="32.679">was</span> <span begin="32.679" end="33.095">young</span> <span begin="33.607" end="34.420">and</span> <span begin="34.420" end="35.505">lost</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在我年少迷茫之时</span></p><p begin="37.196" end="42.961" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.196" end="37.629">You</span> <span begin="37.629" end="38.214">showed</span> <span begin="38.214" end="39.140">up,</span> <span begin="39.747" end="39.949">and</span> <span begin="39.949" end="40.271">had</span> <span begin="40.689" end="40.889">my</span> <span begin="40.889" end="41.208">doors</span> <span begin="41.208" end="41.506">un</span><span begin="41.506" end="42.285">lock</span><span begin="42.285" end="42.961">ed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你悄然出现，为这扇心门开锁</span></p><p begin="45.000" end="50.078" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.000" end="45.262">Like</span> <span begin="45.262" end="46.436">threads,</span> <span begin="46.816" end="47.284">pe</span><span begin="47.284" end="47.778">tals</span> <span begin="48.157" end="48.978">un</span><span begin="48.978" end="50.078">fold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如丝线一般，花瓣舒展</span></p><p begin="51.286" end="57.308" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.286" end="51.778">A</span> <span begin="51.778" end="52.257">red</span> <span begin="52.257" end="52.675">ka</span><span begin="52.675" end="53.250">wa</span><span begin="53.628" end="54.046">ra-</span><span begin="54.046" end="54.488">na</span><span begin="54.488" end="55.018">de</span><span begin="55.720" end="56.289">shi</span><span begin="56.289" end="57.308">ko</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">一朵鲜红的河原抚子花</span></p><p begin="59.053" end="1:13.348" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.053" end="59.456">You</span> <span begin="59.456" end="59.999">have</span> <span begin="59.999" end="1:01.752">shown</span> <span begin="1:01.752" end="1:02.878">me</span> <span begin="1:03.191" end="1:03.647">that</span> <span begin="1:03.647" end="1:04.866">I</span> <span begin="1:04.866" end="1:05.277">am</span> <span begin="1:05.277" end="1:06.456">still</span> <span begin="1:06.810" end="1:07.020">ca</span><span begin="1:07.020" end="1:07.276">pa</span><span begin="1:07.276" end="1:08.614">ble</span> <span begin="1:08.614" end="1:09.045">of</span> <span begin="1:09.045" end="1:09.961">car</span><span begin="1:09.961" end="1:10.378">ing</span> <span begin="1:10.619" end="1:10.830">for</span> <span begin="1:10.830" end="1:11.175">some</span><span begin="1:11.812" end="1:12.071">one</span> <span begin="1:12.667" end="1:13.348">else</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你使我发现，原来我还存有能力关爱他人</span></p><p begin="1:14.097" end="1:25.930" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:14.097" end="1:14.503">That</span> <span begin="1:14.503" end="1:15.889">I</span> <span begin="1:15.889" end="1:16.397">still</span> <span begin="1:16.397" end="1:17.348">bare</span> <span begin="1:17.708" end="1:18.035">the</span> <span begin="1:18.035" end="1:18.968">same</span> <span begin="1:18.968" end="1:19.402">in</span><span begin="1:19.402" end="1:19.859">no</span><span begin="1:19.859" end="1:21.028">cence</span> <span begin="1:21.533" end="1:21.712">in</span><span begin="1:21.712" end="1:25.930">side</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">原来在我的内心深处还留有一份纯真</span></p><p begin="1:26.793" end="1:29.128" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.793" end="1:27.100">Cau</span><span begin="1:27.100" end="1:27.280">se</span> <span begin="1:27.280" end="1:27.712">now</span> <span begin="1:27.712" end="1:27.947">I</span> <span begin="1:27.947" end="1:28.636">know</span> <span begin="1:28.636" end="1:29.128">that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为此刻我明白</span></p><p begin="1:29.128" end="1:32.077" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.128" end="1:29.556">Pain</span> <span begin="1:29.556" end="1:29.734">can</span><span begin="1:29.734" end="1:30.444">not</span> <span begin="1:30.444" end="1:30.799">de</span><span begin="1:30.799" end="1:31.366">fine</span> <span begin="1:31.366" end="1:31.569">the</span> <span begin="1:31.569" end="1:32.077">past</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">疼痛无从定义过去</span></p><p begin="1:32.296" end="1:36.826" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.296" end="1:32.498">We</span> <span begin="1:32.498" end="1:32.736">are</span> <span begin="1:32.736" end="1:33.154">built</span> <span begin="1:33.154" end="1:33.304">to</span> <span begin="1:33.304" end="1:34.550">over</span><span begin="1:34.550" end="1:35.002">come</span> <span begin="1:35.002" end="1:35.238">end</span><span begin="1:35.238" end="1:35.899">less</span> <span begin="1:35.899" end="1:36.368">mis</span><span begin="1:36.368" end="1:36.826">haps</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们生来就被赐予能够跨越无数波折的力量</span></p><p begin="1:37.040" end="1:41.128" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.040" end="1:37.285">You</span> <span begin="1:37.285" end="1:37.537">know,</span> <span begin="1:37.537" end="1:37.901">it</span> <span begin="1:37.901" end="1:38.179">is</span> <span begin="1:38.179" end="1:38.965">not</span> <span begin="1:38.965" end="1:40.008">so</span> <span begin="1:40.008" end="1:41.128">bad</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">其实没有那么苦</span></p><p begin="1:41.368" end="1:43.539" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:41.368" end="1:41.786">When</span> <span begin="1:41.786" end="1:42.238">you</span> <span begin="1:42.238" end="1:42.506">are</span> <span begin="1:42.506" end="1:43.186">with</span> <span begin="1:43.186" end="1:43.539">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为有你和我相伴</span></p><p begin="1:43.599" end="1:46.579" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:43.599" end="1:44.173">Cher</span><span begin="1:44.173" end="1:44.567">ish</span> <span begin="1:44.567" end="1:44.986">as</span> <span begin="1:44.986" end="1:45.465">long</span> <span begin="1:45.465" end="1:45.888">as</span> <span begin="1:45.888" end="1:46.107">we</span> <span begin="1:46.107" end="1:46.579">last</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">在我们的有生之年，珍惜这一切</span></p><p begin="1:46.811" end="1:51.857" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:46.811" end="1:47.136">Cau</span><span begin="1:47.136" end="1:47.266">se</span> <span begin="1:47.266" end="1:47.737">S</span> <span begin="1:47.737" end="1:47.918">is</span> <span begin="1:47.918" end="1:48.623">not</span> <span begin="1:48.623" end="1:48.788">for</span> <span begin="1:48.788" end="1:49.096">sa</span><span begin="1:49.096" end="1:49.979">yo</span><span begin="1:49.979" end="1:50.865">na</span><span begin="1:50.865" end="1:51.857">ra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">因为“再”并不是“再见”的“再”</span></p><p begin="1:52.285" end="1:56.493" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.285" end="1:52.682">Let</span> <span begin="1:52.682" end="1:53.100">mem</span><span begin="1:53.100" end="1:53.387">o</span><span begin="1:53.387" end="1:54.107">ries</span> <span begin="1:54.107" end="1:54.568">play</span> <span begin="1:54.568" end="1:56.493">back</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让我们重播回忆</span></p><p begin="2:23.178" end="2:29.247" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.178" end="2:23.600">I</span> <span begin="2:23.600" end="2:24.187">knew</span> <span begin="2:24.987" end="2:25.452">I</span> <span begin="2:25.452" end="2:26.403">must</span> <span begin="2:26.403" end="2:27.267">step</span> <span begin="2:27.267" end="2:29.247">up</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我确信我必须挺身努力</span></p><p begin="2:29.983" end="2:36.573" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:29.983" end="2:30.437">You</span> <span begin="2:30.437" end="2:30.829">de</span><span begin="2:30.829" end="2:32.477">serve</span> <span begin="2:32.477" end="2:32.678">the</span> <span begin="2:32.678" end="2:33.208">world</span> <span begin="2:33.608" end="2:34.547">and</span> <span begin="2:34.547" end="2:36.573">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你值得拥有整个世界，甚至更多</span></p><p begin="2:37.710" end="2:43.628" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:37.710" end="2:38.022">The</span> <span begin="2:38.022" end="2:38.825">tru</span><span begin="2:38.825" end="2:39.085">th</span> <span begin="2:39.594" end="2:39.966">is</span> <span begin="2:39.966" end="2:40.559">that</span> <span begin="2:40.559" end="2:40.903">you&apos;d</span> <span begin="2:40.903" end="2:41.794">ra</span><span begin="2:41.794" end="2:43.628">ther</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">但其实你更希望</span></p><p begin="2:43.929" end="2:50.954" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:43.929" end="2:44.506">Spend</span> <span begin="2:44.506" end="2:45.452">our</span> <span begin="2:45.452" end="2:46.360">lim</span><span begin="2:46.360" end="2:46.765">it</span><span begin="2:46.765" end="2:47.278">ed</span> <span begin="2:47.278" end="2:47.727">time</span> <span begin="2:48.383" end="2:48.634">to</span><span begin="2:48.634" end="2:49.102">geth</span><span begin="2:49.102" end="2:50.954">er</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">希望我们可以一同度过这有限的时光</span></p><p begin="2:51.745" end="2:59.114" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:51.745" end="2:52.209">Pro</span><span begin="2:52.209" end="2:52.550">tec</span><span begin="2:52.550" end="2:54.100">tion</span> <span begin="2:54.100" end="2:54.556">a</span><span begin="2:54.556" end="2:55.455">lone</span> <span begin="2:55.914" end="2:56.365">is</span> <span begin="2:56.365" end="2:57.725">not</span> <span begin="2:57.725" end="2:58.178">en</span><span begin="2:58.178" end="2:58.648">ou</span><span begin="2:58.648" end="2:59.114">gh</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">仅靠保护远远不够</span></p><p begin="2:59.524" end="3:09.994" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:59.524" end="2:59.759">Pro</span><span begin="2:59.759" end="2:59.998">vid</span><span begin="2:59.998" end="3:01.364">ing</span> <span begin="3:01.364" end="3:01.826">can</span><span begin="3:01.826" end="3:02.580">not</span> <span begin="3:02.580" end="3:03.168">fill</span> <span begin="3:03.360" end="3:03.656">an</span> <span begin="3:03.656" end="3:04.485">emp</span><span begin="3:04.485" end="3:05.374">ty</span> <span begin="3:05.374" end="3:06.186">cup</span> <span begin="3:06.826" end="3:07.244">thirst</span><span begin="3:07.244" end="3:08.594">ing</span> <span begin="3:08.594" end="3:09.093">for</span> <span begin="3:09.093" end="3:09.994">love</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就算付出，也无法填满你那渴求爱的空杯</span></p><p begin="3:10.443" end="3:18.713" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.443" end="3:10.846">I</span> <span begin="3:10.846" end="3:11.778">ques</span><span begin="3:11.778" end="3:12.244">tioned</span> <span begin="3:12.244" end="3:12.572">my</span><span begin="3:12.572" end="3:13.656">self</span> <span begin="3:14.307" end="3:14.565">a</span> <span begin="3:14.565" end="3:18.713">lot–</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我反复自问——</span></p><p begin="3:43.640" end="3:46.396" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:43.640" end="3:44.081">What</span> <span begin="3:44.081" end="3:44.339">do</span> <span begin="3:44.339" end="3:44.997">I</span> <span begin="3:44.997" end="3:45.166">know</span> <span begin="3:45.166" end="3:45.795">about</span> <span begin="3:45.795" end="3:46.396">love?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我懂什么是爱？</span></p><p begin="3:46.824" end="3:51.397" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:46.824" end="3:47.019">How</span> <span begin="3:47.019" end="3:47.220">can</span> <span begin="3:47.220" end="3:47.661">I</span> <span begin="3:47.661" end="3:47.942">re</span><span begin="3:47.942" end="3:48.647">cre</span><span begin="3:48.647" end="3:49.085">ate</span> <span begin="3:49.085" end="3:49.434">what</span> <span begin="3:49.434" end="3:49.749">I&apos;ve</span> <span begin="3:49.749" end="3:50.395">nev</span><span begin="3:50.395" end="3:50.855">er</span> <span begin="3:50.855" end="3:51.397">had?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">明明从未体验过，又怎能把它重现？</span></p><p begin="3:51.810" end="3:57.990" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:51.810" end="3:52.086">All</span> <span begin="3:52.086" end="3:52.450">I</span> <span begin="3:52.450" end="3:52.717">know</span> <span begin="3:52.717" end="3:53.618">is</span> <span begin="3:53.618" end="3:54.344">that</span> <span begin="3:54.344" end="3:54.595">I</span> <span begin="3:54.595" end="3:55.477">must</span> <span begin="3:55.877" end="3:56.229">keep</span> <span begin="3:56.229" end="3:56.964">you</span> <span begin="3:56.964" end="3:57.538">thriv</span><span begin="3:57.538" end="3:57.986">ing</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我只知道，一定要让你茁壮成长</span></p><p begin="3:58.173" end="4:01.121" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:58.173" end="3:58.570">If</span> <span begin="3:58.570" end="3:58.853">nu</span><span begin="3:58.853" end="3:59.499">tri</span><span begin="3:59.499" end="3:59.742">ents</span> <span begin="3:59.742" end="4:00.052">are</span> <span begin="4:00.052" end="4:00.378">what</span> <span begin="4:00.378" end="4:00.752">you</span> <span begin="4:00.752" end="4:01.121">lack</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">若你缺乏养分</span></p><p begin="4:01.389" end="4:09.924" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:01.389" end="4:01.580">I</span> <span begin="4:01.580" end="4:01.832">will</span> <span begin="4:01.832" end="4:02.266">wa</span><span begin="4:02.266" end="4:02.526">ter</span> <span begin="4:02.526" end="4:03.153">you</span> <span begin="4:03.240" end="4:03.653">with</span> <span begin="4:03.653" end="4:04.515">every</span> <span begin="4:04.515" end="4:05.244">drop</span> <span begin="4:05.244" end="4:05.412">of</span> <span begin="4:05.412" end="4:07.913">blood</span> <span begin="4:08.591" end="4:09.073">I</span> <span begin="4:09.073" end="4:09.924">have</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我愿把血液中的每一滴都浇灌给你</span></p><p begin="4:10.448" end="4:12.636" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:10.448" end="4:10.824">But</span> <span begin="4:10.824" end="4:11.344">now</span> <span begin="4:11.344" end="4:11.572">I</span> <span begin="4:11.572" end="4:12.204">know</span> <span begin="4:12.204" end="4:12.636">that</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">如今我终于明白</span></p><p begin="4:12.636" end="4:15.888" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:12.636" end="4:13.098">Sac</span><span begin="4:13.098" end="4:13.329">ri</span><span begin="4:13.329" end="4:13.982">fice</span> <span begin="4:13.982" end="4:14.223">is</span> <span begin="4:14.223" end="4:14.551">the</span> <span begin="4:14.551" end="4:14.934">ea</span><span begin="4:14.934" end="4:15.225">sy</span> <span begin="4:15.225" end="4:15.888">path</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">牺牲之路才是捷径</span></p><p begin="4:15.901" end="4:20.484" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:15.901" end="4:16.345">My</span> <span begin="4:16.345" end="4:16.734">ab</span><span begin="4:16.734" end="4:16.964">sence</span> <span begin="4:16.964" end="4:17.713">can</span><span begin="4:17.713" end="4:18.183">not</span> <span begin="4:18.183" end="4:18.852">ever</span> <span begin="4:18.852" end="4:19.419">chan</span><span begin="4:19.419" end="4:19.579">ge</span> <span begin="4:19.579" end="4:19.928">the</span> <span begin="4:19.928" end="4:20.484">fact</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我的欠缺将无法颠覆这个事实：</span></p><p begin="4:20.661" end="4:27.014" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:20.661" end="4:20.873">I</span> <span begin="4:20.873" end="4:21.212">want</span><span begin="4:21.212" end="4:21.493">ed</span> <span begin="4:21.493" end="4:21.863">the</span> <span begin="4:21.863" end="4:23.627">very</span> <span begin="4:23.627" end="4:24.656">best</span> <span begin="4:24.947" end="4:25.396">for</span> <span begin="4:25.396" end="4:25.883">you,</span> <span begin="4:25.883" end="4:26.162">be</span><span begin="4:26.162" end="4:26.812">lieve</span> <span begin="4:26.812" end="4:27.014">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我其实只愿能给你提供最好的一生</span></p><p begin="4:27.014" end="4:30.223" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:27.014" end="4:27.250">Our</span> <span begin="4:27.250" end="4:27.671">threads</span> <span begin="4:27.671" end="4:27.970">in</span> <span begin="4:27.970" end="4:28.630">red</span> <span begin="4:28.630" end="4:28.852">can</span> <span begin="4:28.852" end="4:29.113">nev</span><span begin="4:29.113" end="4:29.553">er</span> <span begin="4:29.553" end="4:29.793">be</span> <span begin="4:29.793" end="4:30.223">cut</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这条红线将永不会被斩断</span></p><p begin="4:30.451" end="4:35.531" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:30.451" end="4:30.903">And</span> <span begin="4:30.903" end="4:31.364">S</span> <span begin="4:31.364" end="4:31.543">is</span> <span begin="4:31.543" end="4:32.252">not</span> <span begin="4:32.252" end="4:32.424">for</span> <span begin="4:32.424" end="4:32.713">sa</span><span begin="4:32.713" end="4:33.621">yo</span><span begin="4:33.621" end="4:34.503">na</span><span begin="4:34.503" end="4:35.531">ra</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">“再”更不是“再见”的“再”</span></p><p begin="4:35.881" end="4:40.652" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:35.881" end="4:36.363">Will</span> <span begin="4:36.363" end="4:36.736">you</span> <span begin="4:36.736" end="4:37.044">for</span><span begin="4:37.044" end="4:37.519">give</span> <span begin="4:37.519" end="4:37.749">me</span> <span begin="4:37.749" end="4:38.193">at</span> <span begin="4:38.193" end="4:40.652">last?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你愿意最终原谅我吗？</span></p></div></body></tt>